            </div>
            <div class="social-info">
              <h5 class="social-name">facebook</h5>
              <span class="social-username">@runrkids</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="theme-h-line theme-outerline-left theme-outerline-right">
      </div>
      <div class="grid-col-2">
        <div
          class="detai-page-wrapper rr-v-lines-none gray-bg border-left border-right"
        >
          <div
            class="h-100 is-flex is-flex-direction-column is-justify-content-space-between"
          >
            <div class="theme-padding-xs section-xs">
              <h3 class="mb-5 fw-500 line-reveal">Project Overview</h3>
              <p class="has-text-justified line-reveal">
                Pill IQ is an AI-powered mobile healthcare application that
                enables users to identify medicines instantly by simply
                capturing a photo. Leveraging Artificial Intelligence, the app
                recognizes medicines and provides accurate, easy-to-understand
                information, including dosage, uses, side effects, precautions,
                and safety guidelines. Designed with multilingual voice
                assistance and an intuitive interface, Pill IQ makes medication
                information more accessible for patients, caregivers, and
                healthcare-conscious individuals
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="is-relative">
              <div class="theme-h-line"></div>
              <div class="grid-col-6 pb-0">
                <div
                  class="product-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs line-reveal"
                >
                  <h6>Mobile App</h6>
                  <p>Flutter</p>
                </div>
                <div
                  class="product-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs line-reveal"
                >
                  <h6>Backend</h6>
                  <p>FastAPI (Python)</p>
                </div>
                <div
                  class="product-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs line-reveal"
                >
                  <h6>Database</h6>
                  <p>MongoDB</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="theme-h-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-col-6 pb-0">
              <div
                class="product-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs line-reveal"
              >
                <h6>Frontend/Admin</h6>
                <p>Next.js</p>
              </div>
              <div
                class="product-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs line-reveal"
              >
                <h6>AI</h6>
                <p>Image Recognition & Medicine Identification</p>
              </div>
              <div
                class="product-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs line-reveal"
              >
                <h6>Cloud</h6>
                <p>Secure Cloud Infrastructure</p>
