            <li>Increase Google Reviews.</li>
            <li>Automate review request workflows.</li>
            <li>Generate unique QR codes and review links.</li>
            <li>Monitor ratings and customer feedback.</li>
            <li>Provide actionable analytics.</li>
            <li>Improve business credibility and online reputation.</li>
            <li>Build a scalable SaaS platform.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-h-line"></div>

        <div class="case-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs">
