            through a centralized dashboard. The platform automates review
            requests, helping businesses improve customer engagement while
            increasing positive online reviews.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-h-line"></div>
        <div class="case-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs">
          <h3 class="case-detail-heading line-reveal">Client Challenges</h3>
          <p class="line-reveal">
            Before implementing Runr Reviews, the client faced several business
            challenges:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-point line-reveal">
            <li>Low customer review collection rate.</li>
            <li>Manual follow-up for customer feedback.</li>
            <li>Difficulty managing reviews across locations.</li>
            <li>Limited visibility into customer satisfaction.</li>
            <li>Lack of centralized reputation management.</li>
            <li>Inconsistent review request process.</li>
            <li>Poor online brand credibility.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-h-line"></div>
        <div class="case-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs">
          <h3 class="case-detail-heading line-reveal">Challenges</h3>
          <p>
            Our development team addressed several technical and business
            challenges:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-point line-reveal">
            <li>Designing a user-friendly healthcare interface.</li>
            <li>Creating a seamless review collection journey.</li>
            <li>Integrating Google Review workflows.</li>
            <li>Building a scalable multi-business platform.</li>
            <li>Developing secure user authentication.</li>
            <li>Implementing QR code generation.</li>
            <li>Designing an intuitive analytics dashboard.</li>
            <li>Optimizing platform performance.</li>
            <li>Ensuring a responsive experience across all devices.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-h-line"></div>
        <div class="case-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs">
          <h3 class="case-detail-heading line-reveal">Results</h3>
          <ul class="list-point line-reveal">
            <li>Increased customer review collection.</li>
            <li>Improved Google Business ratings.</li>
            <li>Reduced manual follow-up efforts.</li>
            <li>Better customer engagement.</li>
            <li>Centralized review management.</li>
            <li>Faster response to customer feedback.</li>
            <li>Enhanced business credibility.</li>
            <li>Scalable platform for businesses of all sizes.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-h-line"></div>
        <div class="case-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs">
          <h3 class="case-detail-heading line-reveal">Highlighted Features</h3>
          <ul class="list-point line-reveal">
            <li>Google Review QR Codes</li>
            <li>Smart Review Links</li>
            <li>AI-Powered Review Management</li>
            <li>Customer Feedback Collection</li>
            <li>Review Request Automation</li>
            <li>Multi-Business Dashboard</li>
            <li>Reputation Analytics</li>
            <li>Customer Rating Reports</li>
            <li>Business Profile Management</li>
            <li>Review Performance Tracking</li>
            <li>Role-Based User Access</li>
            <li>Mobile Responsive Dashboard</li>
            <li>Secure Authentication</li>
            <li>REST API Integration</li>
            <li>Cloud-Based SaaS Platform</li>
            <li>Fast & Scalable Architecture</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

  <Footer />

<FootScripts page="home" pagetype="onepage" />

<script is:inline>
  // Reveal animation on scroll for .reveal-media elements
  document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
    if (typeof gsap === "undefined" || typeof ScrollTrigger === "undefined")
      return;

    var elements = document.querySelectorAll(".reveal-media");
    if (!elements.length) return;

    elements.forEach(function (el) {
      gsap.set(el, {
        clipPath: "polygon(0% 0%, 0% 0%, 0% 100%, 0% 100%)",
      });

      gsap.to(el, {
        clipPath: "polygon(0% 0%, 100% 0%, 100% 100%, 0% 100%)",
        duration: 1.2,
        ease: "power3.inOut",
        scrollTrigger: {
          trigger: el,
          start: "top 80%",
          once: true,
        },
      });
    });
  });
</script>

<script is:inline>
  // Disable sticky on mobile - ScrollTrigger handles responsive
  (function () {
    if (typeof ScrollTrigger === "undefined") return;
    // Refresh ScrollTrigger after layout settles
    ScrollTrigger.refresh();
  })();
</script>
